WEBVTT

01:36.680 --> 01:38.120
Who's trying to intimidate who here?

01:38.430 --> 01:40.039
And who exactly runs this household?

01:40.590 --> 01:41.950
I'm all ears.

01:44.789 --> 01:46.150
You misheard me.

01:46.920 --> 01:49.229
What brings you

01:49.310 --> 01:50.710
to my quarters at this hour?

01:51.479 --> 01:52.350
Don't you brew medicine

01:52.350 --> 01:53.680
for Madam every day?

01:54.150 --> 01:55.590
I've come to learn how.

02:30.560 --> 02:31.310
There we go.

02:45.750 --> 02:46.430
Master!

02:46.750 --> 02:47.240
She...

02:47.680 --> 02:49.520
She is being completely unreasonable!

02:49.680 --> 02:50.840
Look what she's done to me!

02:57.560 --> 02:58.800
It's just brewing medicine.

02:58.960 --> 03:00.190
No need to make a fuss.

03:00.840 --> 03:02.280
Just brew another batch.

03:02.680 --> 03:03.710
That's not right.

03:04.430 --> 03:05.910
She clearly can't brew medicine,

03:06.240 --> 03:07.870
yet Nanny Zhou lied right to our faces,

03:08.310 --> 03:09.360
saying she does it

03:09.520 --> 03:10.710
for Madam every day.

03:11.520 --> 03:12.400
Even when I caught her red-handed,

03:12.590 --> 03:13.520
she still denied it

03:13.840 --> 03:15.080
and forced Concubine Song to brew it.

03:15.360 --> 03:15.870
Then,

03:16.400 --> 03:17.470
the medicine spilled,

03:18.750 --> 03:19.750
and Concubine Song

03:20.150 --> 03:21.280
nearly caught fire herself.

03:23.680 --> 03:24.470
Nanny,

03:24.710 --> 03:25.960
you're making trouble for no reason.

03:26.360 --> 03:27.870
Are you that bored of peace?

03:28.240 --> 03:29.150
Deliberately sowing discord

03:29.310 --> 03:30.750
between Madam and Lady Song?

03:31.280 --> 03:31.680
I...

03:31.910 --> 03:33.150
I'm innocent!

03:33.360 --> 03:34.680
What I meant was,

03:34.800 --> 03:36.590
she supervises the brewing every night,

03:36.590 --> 03:37.630
she doesn't do it herself!

03:37.800 --> 03:38.750
It was just

03:38.910 --> 03:40.240
a slip of the tongue!

03:41.030 --> 03:41.590
That's right.

03:42.560 --> 03:43.280
Madam,

03:43.680 --> 03:44.710
you know

03:44.800 --> 03:46.190
what kind of person I am.

03:58.630 --> 04:00.280
Jinzhao just came back,

04:01.190 --> 04:02.560
she doesn't know

04:03.870 --> 04:04.840
all the ins and outs here.

04:09.630 --> 04:10.630
How would I not know?

04:11.080 --> 04:12.150
This isn't my first time here.

04:12.630 --> 04:14.190
I came once nine years ago.

04:19.000 --> 04:20.160
Nine years ago?

04:21.480 --> 04:23.070
You came here nine years ago?

04:24.070 --> 04:25.000
You didn't know?

04:25.390 --> 04:26.950
The day after my birthday that year,

04:27.630 --> 04:28.720
I came

04:28.830 --> 04:29.800
to the capital alone,

04:30.310 --> 04:31.920
just to see you and Master.

04:33.310 --> 04:34.240
But when I reached the gate,

04:34.600 --> 04:36.430
I saw Master with Concubine Song.

04:37.360 --> 04:38.630
Not only did he refuse to let me in,

04:39.000 --> 04:40.310
he ordered Nanny Zhou to chase me away.

04:43.870 --> 04:44.510
Master,

04:44.720 --> 04:46.000
- how could you...
- No, no!

04:46.950 --> 04:48.920
That was all a misunderstanding!

04:49.310 --> 04:50.190
I didn't

04:50.480 --> 04:51.870
recognize her at all,

04:52.270 --> 04:53.390
I thought

04:53.430 --> 04:55.070
she was some street urchin!

04:55.800 --> 04:57.000
I never told Nanny Zhou

04:57.000 --> 04:58.000
to chase you away!

05:00.360 --> 05:01.160
Tell me,

05:02.120 --> 05:03.310
what did you do that day?

05:04.800 --> 05:05.510
I

05:06.480 --> 05:07.560
didn't do anything!

05:07.560 --> 05:08.560
Didn't do anything?

05:08.830 --> 05:10.120
She pushed me, hit me,

05:10.390 --> 05:11.630
even pinched me!

05:12.070 --> 05:13.480
I ran far away,

05:13.870 --> 05:15.160
and she still chased after me!

05:15.560 --> 05:16.000
I...

05:17.040 --> 05:17.870
Master...

05:20.310 --> 05:21.430
This is outrageous!

05:21.510 --> 05:23.360
This is outrageous!

05:24.600 --> 05:26.270
You insolent servant!

05:28.390 --> 05:30.360
How dare you overstep your place!

05:30.830 --> 05:31.560
Guards!

05:32.430 --> 05:33.750
Take Nanny Zhou out

05:33.950 --> 05:35.000
and give her ten strokes of the cane!

05:35.120 --> 05:36.190
Only ten strokes?

05:37.159 --> 05:38.630
My neck was swollen from her pinching!

05:38.830 --> 05:39.800
Twenty strokes!

05:40.120 --> 05:41.240
No! Master!

05:41.390 --> 05:42.800
I'm innocent, Master!

05:42.800 --> 05:43.950
Drag her out now!

05:44.270 --> 05:45.310
- I'm innocent!
- Move!

05:45.310 --> 05:46.270
Master!

05:46.480 --> 05:47.430
Please!

05:47.680 --> 05:49.430
I'm innocent!

05:49.870 --> 05:50.870
Master!

05:50.870 --> 05:51.830
Nanny Zhou!

05:58.560 --> 05:59.600
It's getting late.

06:00.270 --> 06:01.160
Get some rest.

06:14.000 --> 06:14.750
Jinzhao.

06:23.040 --> 06:24.160
You're unwell,

06:25.720 --> 06:27.160
you should head back and rest too.

06:58.159 --> 06:59.920
I heard from Mrs. Liu

07:00.160 --> 07:01.510
that Concubine Song's favor

07:01.510 --> 07:03.120
made Nanny Zhou untouchable.

07:03.480 --> 07:04.560
She's never even been scolded,

07:04.560 --> 07:05.750
let alone beaten.

07:06.950 --> 07:08.360
Who would've thought

07:08.480 --> 07:09.040
Master would

07:09.270 --> 07:10.830
actually have her flogged this time.

07:11.630 --> 07:13.680
He's trying to wash his hands of this.

07:14.120 --> 07:15.360
Beating Nanny Zhou

07:15.480 --> 07:16.870
is his way of shutting me up.

07:18.430 --> 07:19.920
He knows full well that

07:20.560 --> 07:22.000
if he wants me

07:22.120 --> 07:23.510
to play along in public,

07:23.630 --> 07:25.390
to prove he never abandoned his daughter,

07:26.270 --> 07:26.870
he has to let me

07:26.870 --> 07:28.360
let out this nine years

07:28.480 --> 07:29.190
of resentment.

07:30.240 --> 07:31.600
But I remember it clear as day.

07:32.000 --> 07:32.920
Nanny Zhou

07:33.240 --> 07:34.480
was nothing but a lapdog.

07:35.720 --> 07:37.630
The one who banned me from the manor

07:38.310 --> 07:39.390
was him, Gu Dezhao.

07:48.120 --> 07:49.920
Jinzhao is truly ruthless.

07:50.240 --> 07:51.159
It's been years,

07:51.310 --> 07:52.240
and she still holds that grudge.

07:54.360 --> 07:55.270
Please,

07:55.560 --> 07:56.750
this is too filthy.

07:58.270 --> 07:59.720
Let Liu Xiang do it.

07:59.830 --> 08:00.870
It's okay.

08:01.270 --> 08:02.630
You raised me from birth,

08:02.870 --> 08:04.040
so was she.

08:04.680 --> 08:05.600
You even diapered and cleaned her,

08:05.720 --> 08:06.870
you never found her dirty back then.

08:07.070 --> 08:08.270
What's wrong with dressing your wounds?

08:08.830 --> 08:09.600
Go ahead.

08:12.270 --> 08:14.040
Be gentle then.

08:14.240 --> 08:15.750
I'm already being as gentle as I can.

08:16.240 --> 08:17.430
You know it hurts now?

08:17.720 --> 08:18.920
If it hurts so much, stop lying

08:18.920 --> 08:20.070
and egging my mother on.

08:20.870 --> 08:22.630
Save yourself from more trouble.

08:23.630 --> 08:25.310
What's wrong with the way you're talking?

08:25.800 --> 08:27.040
It's the truth.

08:28.120 --> 08:29.040
I only lied

08:29.270 --> 08:31.240
for your mother's own good.

08:33.080 --> 08:34.510
For my mother's good?

08:35.120 --> 08:36.000
When Jinzhao

08:36.000 --> 08:37.120
came to the capital alone that year,

08:37.390 --> 08:38.600
a six-year-old child

08:38.789 --> 08:40.320
who'd done nothing to you,

08:40.789 --> 08:42.390
you hurt her so badly.

08:42.510 --> 08:43.870
Was that for my mother's good too?

08:46.630 --> 08:47.600
Be gentler!

08:48.030 --> 08:49.320
Are you trying to get revenge for her

08:49.320 --> 08:49.870
or something?

08:50.720 --> 08:52.120
Fine, fine.

08:52.270 --> 08:53.510
Lan,

08:54.840 --> 08:55.960
do you think

08:56.360 --> 08:58.480
I was born heartless?

08:59.960 --> 09:01.200
Everything I did,

09:02.000 --> 09:03.790
I did for you.

09:04.630 --> 09:05.510
For me?

09:06.000 --> 09:08.870
You've been pampered since childhood.

09:09.360 --> 09:10.120
That's only because

09:10.120 --> 09:12.750
Jinzhao didn't live here.

09:13.600 --> 09:15.440
If she comes back,

09:15.960 --> 09:16.750
everything

09:17.080 --> 09:18.670
will change.

09:20.360 --> 09:21.870
Don't you forget,

09:22.480 --> 09:23.600
Jinzhao

09:23.720 --> 09:25.120
is the legitimate daughter,

09:25.910 --> 09:26.550
and you're...

09:27.790 --> 09:29.000
I'm a concubine's daughter.

09:29.150 --> 09:29.840
Nanny Zhou,

09:30.240 --> 09:31.320
why are you bringing this up?

09:32.550 --> 09:34.200
My sweet girl,

09:34.600 --> 09:36.840
don't blame me for speaking plainly.

09:37.790 --> 09:39.870
There are things in this world

09:40.030 --> 09:43.030
that you have to fight for proactively.

09:43.870 --> 09:45.150
If you wait

09:45.390 --> 09:47.670
until someone comes for you,

09:47.960 --> 09:49.510
it'll be too late.

09:52.120 --> 09:53.200
Jinzhao

09:53.200 --> 09:54.320
is cunning

09:55.030 --> 09:56.440
and ruthless.

09:57.320 --> 09:58.750
We all need to

09:58.910 --> 10:00.790
watch our backs around her from now on.

11:10.270 --> 11:11.030
Nie Fengming!

11:19.720 --> 11:20.720
Lord Chen,

11:21.240 --> 11:22.670
to what do I owe the pleasure?

11:25.240 --> 11:26.720
Why did you do this?

11:28.510 --> 11:29.440
Why?

11:33.240 --> 11:34.510
Because I can't stand you

11:34.510 --> 11:35.670
self-righteous Confucian purists!

11:37.440 --> 11:38.630
Your land equalization policy,

11:39.720 --> 11:41.240
your new tax laws,

11:41.720 --> 11:43.120
all of it is nonsense!

11:44.750 --> 11:46.150
You're just trying to take us down

11:46.150 --> 11:47.270
and expand your own power!

11:47.720 --> 11:49.550
I'll never let you get away with it!

11:50.150 --> 11:51.200
You're a mere Cloud Cavalry Captain,

11:51.200 --> 11:52.790
what right do you have to go against

11:53.200 --> 11:53.840
so many high ministers?

11:54.720 --> 11:56.320
You're a mantis trying to stop a chariot,

11:56.320 --> 11:57.200
utterly foolish.

11:59.790 --> 12:01.600
I know exactly what I'm doing,

12:03.750 --> 12:06.080
I don't need you lecturing me.

12:07.200 --> 12:08.390
You should

12:09.440 --> 12:10.320
worry about

12:10.320 --> 12:12.150
yourself right now.

12:13.630 --> 12:14.720
After this stunt I pulled,

12:16.600 --> 12:17.960
your new tax laws

12:18.870 --> 12:19.510
will never be implemented,

12:19.510 --> 12:21.270
will they?

12:26.480 --> 12:28.360
I'm afraid you'll be disappointed.

12:34.750 --> 12:36.630
His Majesty has issued an imperial edict,

12:37.270 --> 12:38.550
officially launching

12:39.510 --> 12:41.030
the land equalization policy.

12:46.630 --> 12:47.440
What did you say?

12:51.510 --> 12:53.720
His Majesty has issued an imperial edict,

12:53.960 --> 12:55.550
officially launching

12:56.080 --> 12:57.630
the land equalization policy.

13:08.910 --> 13:09.480
You...

13:10.270 --> 13:11.270
What did you say?

13:12.150 --> 13:13.390
Say it again!

13:15.790 --> 13:16.670
I said,

13:17.720 --> 13:19.750
you'll be disappointed.

13:20.150 --> 13:22.870
His Majesty approved land equalization,

13:23.200 --> 13:25.150
with Tongzhou as the first pilot site.

13:27.720 --> 13:29.840
We'll explore paths, assess conditions,

13:30.270 --> 13:31.790
and set a precedent for future rollout.

13:37.080 --> 13:37.720
Good.

13:41.200 --> 13:42.390
Fine!

13:43.150 --> 13:44.080
Chen Yanyun,

13:44.320 --> 13:45.390
you won.

13:46.750 --> 13:47.510
But

13:48.320 --> 13:49.150
the merchants in Tongzhou

13:49.150 --> 13:51.030
are all backed by us hereditary nobles.

13:51.840 --> 13:53.120
I don't think your pilot program

13:53.120 --> 13:54.390
will go as smoothly as you hope.

13:58.390 --> 14:00.750
Well, I have you to thank for that.

14:02.600 --> 14:03.750
Thanks to what you did,

14:04.600 --> 14:05.790
not a single minister

14:05.790 --> 14:07.390
in the court opposed it.

14:13.320 --> 14:14.630
Everything in Tongzhou

14:17.870 --> 14:18.720
is

14:19.480 --> 14:20.960
proceeding in an orderly

14:21.480 --> 14:22.840
and smooth manner.

14:36.150 --> 14:36.910
Well,

14:37.870 --> 14:39.270
congratulations.

14:40.670 --> 14:42.390
I'll be watching from the afterlife,

14:43.600 --> 14:44.600
to see if our Great Yan

14:44.600 --> 14:46.720
can thrive and prosper under your watch,

14:48.480 --> 14:49.960
Chen Yanyun.

15:15.550 --> 15:16.240
Jiuheng,

15:16.960 --> 15:18.270
your new tax policy

15:18.670 --> 15:19.870
is absolutely brilliant.

15:20.670 --> 15:21.320
Let me

15:21.840 --> 15:22.910
join you in this.

15:23.720 --> 15:24.960
You're a Cloud Cavalry Captain,

15:25.080 --> 15:26.550
why meddle in this mess?

15:26.790 --> 15:28.000
So what?

15:28.440 --> 15:29.720
Our ancestors fought and founded

15:29.720 --> 15:30.600
this empire.

15:31.000 --> 15:32.200
I want this dynasty to thrive

15:32.200 --> 15:33.550
more than any of you scholars.

15:34.030 --> 15:35.390
If every minister in the court

15:35.630 --> 15:37.000
thought like you,

15:37.360 --> 15:38.080
the state of the dynasty

15:38.080 --> 15:39.200
wouldn't have fallen this far.

15:39.720 --> 15:40.510
What if

15:40.870 --> 15:42.080
I take the lead in speaking up

15:42.080 --> 15:43.200
for the new tax policy?

15:43.360 --> 15:44.240
Would that help?

15:45.200 --> 15:46.960
If you were a prince or a duke,

15:47.150 --> 15:49.550
that might do some good.

15:49.910 --> 15:50.440
What,

15:50.790 --> 15:52.120
you think my title is too low?

15:52.750 --> 15:54.440
I can round up others to join me!

15:54.750 --> 15:56.000
A whole list of nobles,

15:56.390 --> 15:57.510
from dukes down to barons.

16:05.630 --> 16:06.270
Enough.

16:06.510 --> 16:07.720
You don't have to do a thing.

16:07.960 --> 16:09.240
This path is far too dangerous.

16:09.840 --> 16:11.120
I have nothing to lose,

16:12.360 --> 16:14.320
but you have a wife and daughter.

16:16.720 --> 16:17.870
The safety of the realm

16:18.200 --> 16:19.910
is the responsibility of every man.

16:20.120 --> 16:21.360
If this new tax policy

16:21.360 --> 16:22.440
can help our Great Yan dynasty recover,

16:22.440 --> 16:23.480
I'd gladly

16:24.790 --> 16:26.670
lay down my life for it.

16:42.030 --> 16:43.440
By His Majesty's verbal edict:

16:43.750 --> 16:45.750
Nie Fengming has committed high treason,

16:45.910 --> 16:47.150
uttered reckless slander,

16:47.360 --> 16:48.670
and insulted the Late Emperor.

16:49.480 --> 16:51.390
He is sentenced to death by caning,

16:51.790 --> 16:53.630
to be executed this very day.

17:25.680 --> 17:26.310
That reckless stunt

17:26.640 --> 17:27.880
by Nie Fengming

17:28.160 --> 17:29.070
completely derailed

17:29.310 --> 17:30.480
Prince Glorian's

17:30.480 --> 17:31.640
entire scheme.

17:32.240 --> 17:33.590
It's clear the momentum

17:33.830 --> 17:35.550
is now on

17:35.960 --> 17:37.310
Master Xuan's side.

17:37.720 --> 17:38.720
This momentum

17:39.110 --> 17:41.550
was bought with Nie Fengming's life.

17:42.070 --> 17:43.880
We must not waste his sacrifice.

17:45.400 --> 17:47.270
Once land equalization succeeds,

17:47.400 --> 17:49.920
we will honor his memory at his grave.

17:53.550 --> 17:54.270
Jiuheng?

17:57.160 --> 17:58.270
You look pale.

17:58.350 --> 17:59.270
If you're unwell,

17:59.310 --> 18:00.590
go back and rest.

18:01.350 --> 18:02.830
No one's worked harder than you lately.

18:03.070 --> 18:03.590
Mentor,

18:04.270 --> 18:06.240
I feel no hardship.

18:06.720 --> 18:07.750
I believe

18:08.070 --> 18:08.680
we must not

18:08.960 --> 18:10.550
grow complacent

18:10.960 --> 18:12.160
now that we've made an opening.

18:12.590 --> 18:14.160
Instead, we should seize

18:14.440 --> 18:15.830
His Majesty's full backing to plan

18:16.350 --> 18:17.790
and act early,

18:18.200 --> 18:19.510
clearing the way

18:19.920 --> 18:20.960
for all that follows.

18:21.350 --> 18:22.400
That is the best course of action.

18:23.590 --> 18:24.960
Speak. What's on your mind?

18:25.270 --> 18:25.720
Yes.

18:26.590 --> 18:27.480
With the

18:27.920 --> 18:29.640
military nobles backed down,

18:30.070 --> 18:31.640
the biggest obstacle to our new policy

18:31.960 --> 18:32.830
is Grand Secretary Fan.

18:33.510 --> 18:34.310
We cannot

18:34.790 --> 18:36.000
shake his foundation yet,

18:36.480 --> 18:37.310
but we can first chop off

18:37.920 --> 18:38.790
one of his arms

18:39.000 --> 18:39.750
to weaken his influence.

18:46.160 --> 18:46.830
Who?

18:47.440 --> 18:48.590
Junior Vice Minister of Revenue,

18:49.480 --> 18:50.310
Lin Xianzhong,

19:00.680 --> 19:02.310
Lin Xianzhong.

19:24.590 --> 19:25.680
Congratulations, Lord Lin.

19:27.270 --> 19:27.750
This way.

19:29.000 --> 19:29.720
Please.

19:32.680 --> 19:33.960
Congratulations.

19:34.550 --> 19:35.590
Let me make this clear first,

19:35.920 --> 19:38.000
all gifts must be taken back.

19:38.160 --> 19:39.160
The review is underway.

19:39.310 --> 19:41.160
Let's not land each other in hot water.

19:41.590 --> 19:42.720
We know your rules.

19:42.880 --> 19:43.480
We all

19:43.480 --> 19:44.880
came empty-handed today.

19:44.960 --> 19:46.640
Good, please.

19:52.110 --> 19:52.750
Zonghai.

19:55.200 --> 19:56.350
Lord Lin.

19:56.350 --> 19:57.480
You made it.

19:57.590 --> 19:58.160
Uncle,

19:58.790 --> 19:59.440
why did you drag me

19:59.440 --> 20:00.240
to this birthday banquet?

20:00.240 --> 20:01.830
- Greetings, Young Lord.
- It's dead boring.

20:22.400 --> 20:23.830
The land equalization in Tongzhou

20:24.030 --> 20:25.640
has sparked massive outrage.

20:25.960 --> 20:27.440
Several people have already died.

20:27.790 --> 20:29.550
The leader, Mrs. Ji, has had her house

20:29.720 --> 20:31.590
set on fire multiple times.

20:32.480 --> 20:33.110
Now she tests

20:33.350 --> 20:34.440
every meal

20:34.640 --> 20:36.110
with a silver needle before eating.

20:37.440 --> 20:38.310
No one knows

20:38.480 --> 20:39.880
if she'll survive another day.

20:40.480 --> 20:41.160
Keep your voice down.

20:41.550 --> 20:42.200
Miss,

20:43.400 --> 20:44.270
the Old Madam

20:44.270 --> 20:45.440
is in grave danger.

20:47.960 --> 20:49.640
I knew the land equalization was risky,

20:50.440 --> 20:51.270
but I thought

20:51.480 --> 20:52.270
Mr. Chen

20:52.270 --> 20:52.790
would protect our family

20:52.790 --> 20:54.000
no matter what.

20:54.830 --> 20:55.480
I never imagined

20:55.680 --> 20:57.110
it would come to this.

21:00.480 --> 21:01.720
Lord Chen, this way please.

21:02.030 --> 21:02.550
Very well.

21:03.680 --> 21:04.480
Mr. Chen?

21:05.240 --> 21:05.750
Miss,

21:06.200 --> 21:07.640
why is he here?

21:13.880 --> 21:14.400
Listen,

21:14.830 --> 21:15.750
go keep watch up front.

21:16.030 --> 21:16.920
If anyone asks,

21:17.070 --> 21:18.070
say I've gone to powder my nose.

21:21.030 --> 21:22.350
Are you going to find him?

21:23.880 --> 21:25.310
We finally crossed paths today.

21:25.640 --> 21:26.440
I can't let this chance slip.

21:27.110 --> 21:28.160
Even if it's just for Grandmother,

21:28.440 --> 21:29.550
I have to beg him.

21:30.440 --> 21:31.000
I'm going.

21:36.070 --> 21:37.640
[Where on earth is she going?]

21:39.110 --> 21:40.000
I had no idea

21:40.160 --> 21:41.550
I'd intrude on your wife's birthday.

21:41.790 --> 21:43.880
My apologies for the intrusion.

21:44.750 --> 21:46.440
I think

21:47.510 --> 21:49.680
you didn't intrude by accident.

21:50.310 --> 21:51.160
You picked today

21:51.160 --> 21:52.640
on purpose.

21:53.960 --> 21:55.750
Let's cut to the chase.

21:55.880 --> 21:57.680
Speak your

21:57.680 --> 21:59.160
mind plainly.

22:00.680 --> 22:01.440
Very well.

22:01.960 --> 22:03.110
To be frank,

22:03.510 --> 22:04.790
I've come today

22:05.200 --> 22:06.310
to ask

22:06.350 --> 22:07.550
a great favor of you.

22:09.960 --> 22:11.070
What favor?

22:11.640 --> 22:12.790
I'm asking you

22:13.640 --> 22:15.160
to step down voluntarily,

22:15.400 --> 22:17.270
and yield your post

22:17.790 --> 22:18.750
as Junior Vice Minister of Revenue.

22:21.160 --> 22:22.110
What did you say?

22:24.110 --> 22:25.550
Don't get agitated just yet.

22:25.830 --> 22:27.350
The Criminal Investigation Bureau

22:27.590 --> 22:28.640
arrested a man from Zhejiang

22:28.640 --> 22:30.400
named Su Yuanhang.

22:30.750 --> 22:31.880
He confessed that

22:32.070 --> 22:33.350
he acquired over 30,000 mu

22:34.270 --> 22:35.830
of prime paddy fields in Yuyao

22:35.830 --> 22:37.920
on your orders,

22:38.240 --> 22:38.880
for less than

22:38.960 --> 22:40.960
two thousand taels of silver.

22:52.070 --> 22:52.640
Oh,

22:53.680 --> 22:54.640
and he also said

22:54.920 --> 22:56.720
you sent men to Datong

22:57.270 --> 22:59.590
to dig up dirt on Grand Secretary Fan's

22:59.590 --> 23:00.790
family back home.

23:01.550 --> 23:02.750
I couldn't believe it

23:02.880 --> 23:04.030
at first.

23:04.270 --> 23:05.440
Everyone in court knows

23:05.440 --> 23:06.110
how close you are

23:06.110 --> 23:07.550
to Grand Secretary Fan.

23:08.440 --> 23:10.070
Why would you

23:10.480 --> 23:12.480
spy on him behind his back?

23:12.750 --> 23:13.270
He...

23:13.550 --> 23:15.110
he's lying.

23:22.750 --> 23:24.640
You're lying.

23:25.240 --> 23:25.920
I've never

23:27.110 --> 23:28.830
met this man in my life.

23:29.880 --> 23:31.310
I see.

23:36.680 --> 23:37.400
My lord,

23:37.750 --> 23:39.070
the Lady is asking where you've gone.

23:39.070 --> 23:40.030
The feast is about to begin.

23:41.000 --> 23:42.070
You may

23:42.240 --> 23:43.510
go to the banquet first.

23:44.270 --> 23:46.000
We can talk more later.

24:03.960 --> 24:05.200
Send someone

24:05.550 --> 24:06.440
to check if Su Yuanhang

24:06.440 --> 24:07.440
has really been arrested.

24:07.550 --> 24:07.960
Understood.

24:08.000 --> 24:08.480
Wait.

24:10.480 --> 24:12.270
Go yourself.

24:12.680 --> 24:13.720
Be careful on the way.

24:25.110 --> 24:26.960
[I never thought Chen Yanyun]

24:27.270 --> 24:28.720
[could be so ruthless and underhanded.]

24:32.750 --> 24:33.350
Miss Gu,

24:33.830 --> 24:35.030
Mr. Chen has asked for you.

24:36.400 --> 24:37.070
Me?

24:37.480 --> 24:37.960
Yes.

24:56.270 --> 24:56.830
Speak.

24:57.310 --> 24:58.880
Why have you been following me?

24:59.960 --> 25:01.750
I saw you were coming to the Lin Manor,

25:02.000 --> 25:03.160
so I followed.

25:05.920 --> 25:06.590
Is

25:07.240 --> 25:08.510
everything alright with you?

25:08.880 --> 25:11.000
The Ji family works for me.

25:12.830 --> 25:14.480
Don't beat around the bush with me.

25:17.510 --> 25:19.000
You saw right through me.

25:19.720 --> 25:20.880
I heard there's been trouble

25:21.480 --> 25:24.200
with the land equalization.

25:25.480 --> 25:26.350
I came to ask

25:26.720 --> 25:28.720
how my grandmother is doing.

25:30.440 --> 25:31.550
There have been a few setbacks,

25:31.920 --> 25:33.510
but nothing we didn't expect.

25:33.960 --> 25:35.070
Your grandmother

25:35.070 --> 25:36.200
has a dedicated guard detail.

25:36.550 --> 25:37.480
You don't need to worry.

25:39.640 --> 25:40.480
That's a relief.

25:42.510 --> 25:43.270
Well,

25:44.270 --> 25:45.030
Sir,

25:46.350 --> 25:47.550
I also wanted to ask...

25:47.880 --> 25:48.720
how much longer

25:48.920 --> 25:50.510
will the land equalization take?

25:51.110 --> 25:52.240
Grandmother is old.

25:52.400 --> 25:53.510
I fear she can't keep this up.

25:54.030 --> 25:56.270
These are not questions for you to ask.

25:57.070 --> 25:58.720
Land equalization is state policy,

25:59.440 --> 26:00.830
not child's play.

26:04.920 --> 26:05.920
I know my place.

26:06.680 --> 26:07.920
I won't speak of it again.

26:12.310 --> 26:13.030
In that case,

26:13.550 --> 26:15.070
I'd rather return to Tongzhou,

26:15.270 --> 26:16.510
to stay by Grandmother's side.

26:16.790 --> 26:17.960
It would put my mind at ease.

26:18.960 --> 26:19.960
You want to go back?

26:20.200 --> 26:20.830
Yes.

26:23.790 --> 26:24.720
What are you afraid of?

26:28.310 --> 26:29.270
I beg your forgiveness.

26:34.400 --> 26:36.070
Your grandmother volunteered

26:36.270 --> 26:37.310
to lead the land equalization.

26:37.960 --> 26:39.550
Words are not enough.

26:40.070 --> 26:41.750
She must take the risks

26:42.070 --> 26:43.240
and make

26:43.880 --> 26:44.790
the sacrifices.

26:45.400 --> 26:46.440
For me,

26:46.960 --> 26:47.880
the Tongzhou pilot

26:47.880 --> 26:49.270
is more than just a trial.

26:49.830 --> 26:51.030
It is the first step

26:51.030 --> 26:53.000
of the new tax policy.

26:54.070 --> 26:54.720
It

26:54.960 --> 26:55.720
will succeed.

26:57.030 --> 26:57.640
It

26:58.640 --> 26:59.480
must succeed.

27:00.880 --> 27:03.030
I entrusted this critical mission

27:03.030 --> 27:04.350
to your grandmother.

27:05.510 --> 27:07.030
She must show her resolve,

27:07.350 --> 27:08.160
prove she is willing

27:08.160 --> 27:09.750
to burn her boats.

27:10.640 --> 27:11.200
Only then

27:11.880 --> 27:14.160
can I fully trust her.

27:15.160 --> 27:15.920
Do you

27:16.920 --> 27:18.110
agree?

27:22.070 --> 27:22.750
Yes.

27:24.310 --> 27:25.160
I understand.

27:27.510 --> 27:28.960
I am that resolve.

27:31.350 --> 27:32.750
Your grandmother often says,

27:34.000 --> 27:35.030
trim your sails to the wind,

27:35.200 --> 27:36.400
cut your coat to fit your cloth.

27:37.030 --> 27:38.270
No one knows better

27:38.270 --> 27:39.400
than her

27:41.070 --> 27:42.960
which way the wind is blowing.

27:55.310 --> 27:55.790
Yes,

27:57.160 --> 27:58.550
land equalization is dangerous.

27:59.350 --> 28:00.640
Gravely dangerous.

28:00.920 --> 28:01.960
But you must understand,

28:03.680 --> 28:04.880
since time immemorial,

28:05.110 --> 28:06.200
land equalization has never been

28:07.070 --> 28:08.440
achieved without bloodshed.

28:09.640 --> 28:11.070
The blood of our opponents,

28:11.830 --> 28:13.510
and the blood of our own.

28:14.640 --> 28:15.960
But Chen Yanyun

28:16.240 --> 28:17.680
will never be the first to bleed.

28:25.350 --> 28:26.350
Greetings, Young Lord.

28:26.640 --> 28:27.720
Greetings.

28:29.590 --> 28:31.310
Quite the imposing authority you have.

28:31.590 --> 28:33.030
Everyone is paying birthday respects,

28:33.310 --> 28:34.000
yet here you are,

28:34.750 --> 28:36.310
hiding away in the backyard.

28:37.000 --> 28:38.750
I do not care for crowds.

28:39.920 --> 28:40.830
You don't even

28:41.110 --> 28:42.790
believe that yourself, do you?

28:46.070 --> 28:47.680
Did you come here to see him?

28:48.590 --> 28:49.240
Don't you know

28:49.240 --> 28:50.310
a weasel doesn't sneak into the henhouse

28:50.440 --> 28:51.310
for nothing?

28:53.880 --> 28:55.680
You jest, my lord.

28:55.880 --> 28:56.830
I never jest

28:56.830 --> 28:58.400
with men like you.

28:58.880 --> 29:00.750
Everyone in court knows Lin Xianzhong

29:01.240 --> 29:03.000
is Fan Chuan's right-hand man,

29:03.000 --> 29:04.070
and you are Fu Hailian's star pupil.

29:04.830 --> 29:05.920
Fan Chuan and Fu Hailian

29:05.920 --> 29:07.400
are sworn enemies.

29:08.030 --> 29:09.510
Yet here you are,

29:09.830 --> 29:11.030
not joining the feast,

29:11.550 --> 29:13.270
but lingering deep in the backyard.

29:14.030 --> 29:14.750
If this isn't

29:15.240 --> 29:16.590
a weasel in the henhouse,

29:17.030 --> 29:17.790
what is it?

29:28.000 --> 29:28.880
Young Lord,

29:29.790 --> 29:30.510
Mr. Chen,

29:31.720 --> 29:33.440
you two carry on.

29:34.790 --> 29:36.160
I've been out too long.

29:36.400 --> 29:37.350
I should head back.

29:43.270 --> 29:44.030
I'm leaving too.

29:55.070 --> 29:55.550
My lord,

29:55.790 --> 29:56.270
Young Lord Ye

29:56.270 --> 29:57.590
came specifically looking for Miss Gu.

29:59.350 --> 30:00.270
It seems

30:00.550 --> 30:02.070
the two of them have grown quite close.

30:07.510 --> 30:08.110
Gu Jinzhao.

30:10.030 --> 30:11.000
What do you want?

30:12.590 --> 30:13.720
Why did you go looking for him?

30:15.070 --> 30:16.030
It's none of your business.

30:17.830 --> 30:18.720
I'm warning you.

30:19.480 --> 30:20.480
You'd better stay away from him.

30:21.960 --> 30:23.030
What do you mean?

30:24.030 --> 30:25.160
I know you hate your father,

30:25.510 --> 30:26.750
but you still bear the Gu family name.

30:27.110 --> 30:28.160
Do you know the entire Gu family

30:28.160 --> 30:29.400
is in Fan Chuan's faction?

30:30.480 --> 30:31.550
I didn't before.

30:31.750 --> 30:32.640
I do now.

30:32.920 --> 30:34.110
That's why I need to get back quickly.

30:35.960 --> 30:36.400
You...

30:39.880 --> 30:40.590
Cheers.

30:40.590 --> 30:41.720
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

30:41.720 --> 30:42.510
- Drink.
- Cheers.

30:45.880 --> 30:46.550
Master,

30:47.350 --> 30:49.310
the young lady wishes to leave early.

30:50.270 --> 30:51.310
Help yourselves, everyone.

30:56.400 --> 30:57.880
The feast is barely halfway through.

30:58.240 --> 30:59.200
How can you want to leave?

30:59.790 --> 31:01.030
Where's your manner?

31:04.030 --> 31:04.830
Stand aside.

31:08.510 --> 31:09.160
Master,

31:09.400 --> 31:10.680
Madam has sudden heart palpitations.

31:10.680 --> 31:11.830
Madam is calling for you to return.

31:14.750 --> 31:16.000
How could this happen?

31:18.200 --> 31:19.070
Lord Lin,

31:19.270 --> 31:20.920
my wife has fallen suddenly ill.

31:21.070 --> 31:22.830
I cannot stay,

31:23.160 --> 31:24.070
I must take my leave.

31:25.110 --> 31:26.110
Of course.

31:26.270 --> 31:27.880
Your wife's health comes first.

31:28.070 --> 31:29.000
Go.

31:29.030 --> 31:29.590
Very well.

31:29.680 --> 31:31.310
How did she suddenly have heart pains?

31:31.550 --> 31:32.440
Should I

31:32.750 --> 31:33.790
- come with you?
- Dezhao,

31:34.000 --> 31:34.720
you stay here.

31:35.680 --> 31:37.000
I'll take him back first

31:37.000 --> 31:37.920
to check on her.

31:38.000 --> 31:38.640
Let's go.

31:39.720 --> 31:41.480
You hurry back to see her.

31:44.480 --> 31:45.000
Miss Gu.

31:48.880 --> 31:49.270
Miss Gu,

31:49.270 --> 31:50.200
- you look
- Mentor,

31:50.200 --> 31:51.400
- absolutely stunning today.
- to be frank,

31:51.480 --> 31:52.400
if my

31:52.750 --> 31:54.000
mother-in-law hadn't stopped me,

31:54.720 --> 31:56.400
I would have brought

31:56.590 --> 31:57.720
the child back long ago.

31:58.400 --> 31:59.750
I don't mind you all laughing.

32:00.350 --> 32:01.160
I'm just a man

32:01.790 --> 32:02.550
who cares

32:03.270 --> 32:05.000
deeply for his children.

32:07.000 --> 32:07.640
Miss Gu,

32:08.110 --> 32:09.510
- your father is so good to you.
- Eat.

32:11.240 --> 32:12.640
[How dare he say that.]

32:13.000 --> 32:13.550
[No,]

32:13.750 --> 32:14.790
[I have to think of something.]

32:15.440 --> 32:16.240
Yes,

32:16.720 --> 32:17.510
though I live

32:17.830 --> 32:19.590
in Tongzhou most days,

32:20.110 --> 32:21.110
my father

32:21.240 --> 32:22.920
comes to visit me often.

32:23.590 --> 32:24.880
He and his concubine

32:24.920 --> 32:26.200
even made the trip specially

32:26.590 --> 32:28.110
for my coming-of-age ceremony

32:28.350 --> 32:29.750
in Tongzhou.

32:33.400 --> 32:35.000
My wife is in poor health

32:35.550 --> 32:36.640
and cannot stand traveling.

32:37.200 --> 32:38.590
The household affairs have long been

32:38.750 --> 32:39.960
managed by one of my concubines,

32:40.110 --> 32:40.920
so I

32:40.920 --> 32:42.070
brought her along

32:42.350 --> 32:43.480
to the ceremony in Tongzhou.

32:44.550 --> 32:45.590
Indeed.

32:45.880 --> 32:47.960
My concubine is from a prestigious clan,

32:48.350 --> 32:49.480
well-educated and refined.

32:49.750 --> 32:51.270
She is the daughter of the former

32:51.270 --> 32:52.880
Chief of the Court of Imperial Sacrifices.

32:53.270 --> 32:54.790
Really?

32:54.920 --> 32:56.510
Could it be Song Shiqi,

32:56.510 --> 32:58.200
who retired from office

32:58.200 --> 32:59.200
five years ago?

33:02.160 --> 33:03.590
To think he would

33:03.680 --> 33:04.400
marry his daughter

33:04.400 --> 33:05.590
to Lord Gu as a concubine.

33:06.030 --> 33:07.030
Truly remarkable.

33:07.110 --> 33:07.960
One dared to marry into it,

33:08.350 --> 33:09.400
the other dared to take her.

33:12.640 --> 33:13.550
You never

33:13.960 --> 33:15.590
spoke of this before.

33:17.590 --> 33:18.400
My wife

33:18.920 --> 33:20.240
is from a merchant family,

33:20.680 --> 33:22.110
so my mother arranged for me

33:22.310 --> 33:24.590
to take Lady Song as a concubine.

33:25.270 --> 33:27.590
I knew it was improper,

33:27.720 --> 33:28.440
so

33:28.590 --> 33:30.880
I never spoke of it publicly.

33:32.310 --> 33:34.110
Even so, a concubine

33:34.440 --> 33:36.720
has no right to run the household.

33:37.160 --> 33:38.790
You are quite right.

33:39.270 --> 33:40.720
My mother also said,

33:41.030 --> 33:42.110
if my wife's health

33:42.920 --> 33:43.880
does not improve,

33:43.880 --> 33:44.720
we should move back

33:44.790 --> 33:45.960
to the family's ancestral estate,

33:46.550 --> 33:47.790
so the brothers

33:48.240 --> 33:49.480
can look out for each other.

33:51.350 --> 33:52.240
But

33:52.590 --> 33:54.110
moving is no small matter.

33:54.590 --> 33:56.110
We need to renovate the house,

33:56.310 --> 33:57.790
make new furniture.

33:58.200 --> 34:00.000
How can I afford that

34:00.350 --> 34:01.680
on my meager official salary?

34:03.000 --> 34:04.640
Everyone says the capital is wealthy,

34:04.790 --> 34:06.200
but I never believed it until now.

34:06.510 --> 34:08.630
It's truly opened my eyes.

34:09.190 --> 34:09.960
For example,

34:10.150 --> 34:11.550
Lady Song drinks a bowl of

34:11.710 --> 34:12.280
bird's nest soup

34:12.280 --> 34:14.190
every single day.

34:14.800 --> 34:16.440
Even though my grandmother's family

34:16.440 --> 34:17.760
is wealthy in Tongzhou,

34:18.360 --> 34:20.110
we would never spend so frivolously.

34:20.400 --> 34:20.920
Shut your mouth.

34:22.400 --> 34:23.000
I...

34:28.440 --> 34:29.440
I must take my leave.

34:35.480 --> 34:36.030
Let's go.

34:43.630 --> 34:44.230
Sir,

34:44.510 --> 34:45.360
just as you expected.

34:45.630 --> 34:46.590
Lin Xianzhong did send someone

34:46.590 --> 34:47.670
to meet Su Yuanhang.

34:48.030 --> 34:48.630
We've now

34:48.840 --> 34:49.710
caught him red-handed.

34:52.400 --> 34:53.510
What's happening up front?

34:53.880 --> 34:54.800
Gu Deyuan was the first to leave,

34:55.150 --> 34:56.630
with Gu Dezhao right on his heels.

34:57.320 --> 34:58.280
Good.

34:59.070 --> 35:01.190
Lest he be implicated

35:01.920 --> 35:03.070
and drag the Ji family down with him.

35:06.760 --> 35:08.440
He's finally learned some sense.

35:08.800 --> 35:10.030
Did Gu Deyuan tip him off?

35:10.230 --> 35:10.710
No,

35:11.110 --> 35:11.920
it was Miss Gu.

35:12.590 --> 35:13.630
She deliberately

35:14.030 --> 35:15.230
undermined Lord Gu at the banquet.

35:15.590 --> 35:16.510
Every word he said,

35:16.710 --> 35:17.880
she shot him down,

35:18.230 --> 35:19.510
embarrassing him so badly

35:19.710 --> 35:20.710
in front of everyone

35:21.230 --> 35:21.960
that he had no choice but to leave.

35:23.760 --> 35:24.880
Interesting.

35:26.670 --> 35:28.440
She killed two birds with one stone.

35:30.070 --> 35:31.030
Two birds with one stone?

35:31.760 --> 35:32.480
She publicly

35:32.480 --> 35:34.070
humiliated Gu Dezhao,

35:34.400 --> 35:36.030
and kept him out of trouble.

35:36.710 --> 35:38.230
What else would you call it?

35:41.510 --> 35:42.480
But,

35:43.800 --> 35:46.070
it harms her as much as it harms him.

35:47.030 --> 35:48.230
Is everything ready outside?

35:48.440 --> 35:49.070
All set.

35:51.510 --> 35:52.000
Good.

35:52.400 --> 35:53.440
Let's go take a look.

35:53.880 --> 35:54.360
Understood.

35:56.480 --> 35:58.480
Master!

36:03.480 --> 36:04.320
Bad news.

36:04.510 --> 36:05.670
A lot of the guests are leaving.

36:06.110 --> 36:07.360
Let them go.

36:07.920 --> 36:09.150
Have you

36:09.440 --> 36:10.510
made your decision?

36:14.360 --> 36:15.400
About what?

36:16.280 --> 36:18.190
You fabricated this whole thing

36:18.710 --> 36:20.190
to frame me!

36:20.630 --> 36:21.400
Frame you?

36:23.760 --> 36:25.590
Has your steward

36:25.710 --> 36:26.840
returned yet?

36:27.190 --> 36:28.070
He went...

36:33.230 --> 36:34.590
Did you

36:35.030 --> 36:36.000
have him followed?

36:36.280 --> 36:37.030
Thanks to him,

36:37.480 --> 36:38.070
the Criminal Investigation Bureau

36:38.070 --> 36:40.000
caught Su Yuanhang

36:40.360 --> 36:41.590
without breaking a sweat.

36:42.230 --> 36:42.840
Or rather,

36:43.440 --> 36:44.590
thanks

36:45.710 --> 36:46.960
to you.

36:59.760 --> 37:01.030
Lord... Lord Chen,

37:01.440 --> 37:03.360
please spare Su Yuanhang.

37:03.760 --> 37:04.480
I will

37:05.480 --> 37:07.230
submit my resignation at once,

37:08.000 --> 37:09.590
I will yield the post

37:10.190 --> 37:11.400
to... to...

37:11.800 --> 37:12.510
Fu Hailian.

37:12.800 --> 37:13.710
I'm afraid

37:14.920 --> 37:16.150
that won't work.

37:16.590 --> 37:18.320
Resignation needs a solid reason.

37:18.590 --> 37:19.550
What's more,

37:20.190 --> 37:21.070
if His Majesty

37:21.070 --> 37:22.280
asks you to stay,

37:22.760 --> 37:24.110
it will only cause more trouble.

37:29.480 --> 37:31.150
What exactly do you want from me?

37:41.960 --> 37:42.960
What...

37:43.960 --> 37:45.000
You've amassed quite a fortune

37:45.150 --> 37:46.440
during your years in office.

37:46.760 --> 37:48.320
Pleading guilty to corruption and

37:48.630 --> 37:49.800
dereliction of duty is no injustice.

37:50.230 --> 37:51.840
It's better than hiding undeclared land,

37:52.320 --> 37:53.510
and a hundred times better than

37:53.670 --> 37:54.880
secretly betraying and spying

37:55.190 --> 37:56.590
on Grand Secretary Fan.

37:59.150 --> 38:00.110
Don't you agree?

38:07.480 --> 38:09.110
Chen Yanyun,

38:09.880 --> 38:11.960
you're slaving away for Fu Hailian.

38:12.150 --> 38:13.510
Have you ever thought about

38:13.800 --> 38:15.320
what will happen to you in the end?

38:15.590 --> 38:16.760
I haven't gotten around to that.

38:17.400 --> 38:18.030
But

38:18.550 --> 38:20.710
thank you for the warning.

38:25.550 --> 38:26.320
Good day.

38:44.800 --> 38:45.280
Miss!

38:46.150 --> 38:46.630
Miss!

38:47.920 --> 38:48.510
Lin Xianzhong

38:48.510 --> 38:49.800
has been arrested.

38:51.400 --> 38:52.070
What?

38:52.710 --> 38:54.150
I heard from the servants up front

38:54.320 --> 38:55.070
that he was seized

38:55.070 --> 38:56.400
right at the banquet, on charges of

38:56.880 --> 38:58.280
corruption and dereliction of duty.

38:58.590 --> 39:00.000
Everyone on Revenue Street

39:00.110 --> 39:01.110
is talking about it right now.

39:05.400 --> 39:06.440
It's Chen Yanyun.

39:07.510 --> 39:08.510
It has to be.

39:12.510 --> 39:13.440
He moves

39:13.550 --> 39:14.590
so fast.

39:15.030 --> 39:16.000
I entrusted

39:16.360 --> 39:17.480
this critical mission

39:17.480 --> 39:18.670
to your grandmother.

39:19.070 --> 39:20.550
She must show her resolve,

39:20.960 --> 39:21.880
prove she is willing

39:21.880 --> 39:23.440
to burn her boats.

39:24.550 --> 39:25.070
Only then

39:25.550 --> 39:27.710
can I fully trust her.

39:28.800 --> 39:29.550
Do you

39:30.630 --> 39:31.760
agree?

39:35.190 --> 39:36.000
Qingpu,

39:37.440 --> 39:38.320
I think

39:38.710 --> 39:40.030
he's got his eye on us too.

39:42.000 --> 39:42.710
Why?

39:44.280 --> 39:45.590
I can't be sure yet.

39:46.630 --> 39:47.880
Something about this doesn't add up.

39:48.030 --> 39:48.510
Here,

39:48.510 --> 39:49.320
go grind my ink.

39:49.440 --> 39:51.150
I need to write a letter to Grandmother.

39:59.190 --> 40:00.480
[There must be something else going on]

40:00.480 --> 40:01.800
[around the time of my ceremony.]

40:15.360 --> 40:16.710
Sir, you're back.

40:17.070 --> 40:17.920
What are you doing here?

40:20.000 --> 40:20.710
The letter Miss Gu

40:20.710 --> 40:22.110
wrote to Old Madam Ji

40:22.320 --> 40:23.230
was intercepted by our men

40:23.360 --> 40:24.150
and brought here first.

40:25.670 --> 40:26.510
Miss Gu?

40:38.920 --> 40:39.400
Well?

40:39.760 --> 40:41.150
Is there anything interesting in it?

40:42.150 --> 40:43.360
She writes that

40:44.070 --> 40:45.440
she met me once

40:45.440 --> 40:46.400
while in the capital,

40:47.320 --> 40:49.150
and found me unpredictable,

40:49.670 --> 40:51.280
my words holding hidden meaning.

40:52.190 --> 40:53.480
She also asks Madam Ji

40:53.960 --> 40:55.440
if anything happened

40:57.070 --> 40:57.630
involving me around the time

40:57.630 --> 40:59.030
of her ceremony.

40:59.440 --> 41:00.800
So it seems Miss Gu

41:01.480 --> 41:02.440
knows nothing about

41:02.440 --> 41:04.070
what happened with Prince Ruichang's son

41:04.150 --> 41:04.920
that night.

41:04.920 --> 41:05.800
Not necessarily.

41:06.070 --> 41:07.000
She might

41:07.110 --> 41:08.030
have guessed

41:08.030 --> 41:09.550
we have people watching her,

41:09.710 --> 41:11.190
and wrote this letter on purpose

41:11.190 --> 41:12.030
as a smokescreen.

41:12.150 --> 41:13.150
Is that possible?

41:13.360 --> 41:14.840
For all her cleverness,

41:14.840 --> 41:16.320
Miss Gu couldn't be that sharp.

41:16.630 --> 41:17.800
It might be because

41:18.110 --> 41:18.710
I deliberately rattled her

41:19.110 --> 41:20.440
at the Lin Manor that day.

41:22.000 --> 41:22.590
Why?

41:23.840 --> 41:25.070
Since time immemorial,

41:25.280 --> 41:26.510
land equalization has never been

41:27.110 --> 41:28.550
achieved without bloodshed.

41:29.280 --> 41:30.710
The blood of our opponents,

41:31.400 --> 41:33.070
and the blood of our own.

41:39.800 --> 41:42.030
If Mr. Chen never sees the letter,

41:42.030 --> 41:42.920
so be it.

41:43.710 --> 41:44.920
But if he does,

41:45.630 --> 41:46.960
he'll know

41:47.510 --> 41:48.550
I'm declaring

41:49.000 --> 41:50.710
my loyalty to him.

41:52.710 --> 41:54.400
But if Miss Gu

41:54.510 --> 41:56.480
wrote this letter on purpose...

41:56.670 --> 41:58.400
Then she's declaring her loyalty to me.

41:58.550 --> 41:59.550
Telling me

42:00.150 --> 42:01.360
she knows nothing,

42:01.920 --> 42:03.070
and even if she did,

42:03.590 --> 42:04.590
she wouldn't breathe a word of it.

42:07.840 --> 42:08.920
She is

42:08.920 --> 42:10.070
really something.

42:10.590 --> 42:11.030
Alright,

42:11.320 --> 42:12.190
seal the letter

42:12.590 --> 42:14.280
back up exactly as it was,

42:14.710 --> 42:15.960
and send it on to the Ji family.

42:17.710 --> 42:18.110
Understood.

42:18.440 --> 42:19.320
Should our men

42:19.320 --> 42:20.400
keep following her?

42:20.480 --> 42:20.880
Yes.

42:21.360 --> 42:22.320
I want to see

42:22.480 --> 42:24.110
just how far she's willing to go.

42:25.320 --> 42:25.760
Oh,

42:26.360 --> 42:27.760
and there's a name

42:27.760 --> 42:28.960
missing from the archive files.

42:29.280 --> 42:30.510
I need to ask you about him.

42:31.070 --> 42:31.590
Who?

42:32.480 --> 42:33.360
Liu Siyu.

42:34.230 --> 42:35.480
The director of Ministry of Revenue?

42:35.760 --> 42:36.110
Yes.

42:36.440 --> 42:36.960
What,

42:37.110 --> 42:38.880
the Chief Councilor wants to promote him

42:39.110 --> 42:40.320
to replace Lin Xianzhong

42:40.320 --> 42:41.590
as Junior Vice Minister of Revenue?

42:41.590 --> 42:42.480
Most likely.

42:44.960 --> 42:45.630
Master,

42:46.030 --> 42:47.480
Lord Lin is finished.

42:47.840 --> 42:48.920
You're his protégé.

42:49.400 --> 42:50.710
Will you be implicated?

42:51.480 --> 42:52.280
No.

42:53.840 --> 42:55.150
After I left the Lin Manor,

42:55.550 --> 42:58.030
he publicly

42:58.550 --> 43:00.800
distanced himself.

43:03.000 --> 43:04.360
Some mentor he is,

43:04.480 --> 43:05.960
so heartless.

43:06.440 --> 43:07.400
Then it seems

43:07.880 --> 43:09.230
Jinzhao really

43:09.230 --> 43:10.440
saved you this time.

43:11.960 --> 43:12.670
She just

43:12.960 --> 43:15.710
got lucky, that's all.

43:16.800 --> 43:17.960
Speaking of Jinzhao,

43:18.320 --> 43:20.480
tomorrow you go find a matchmaker.

43:20.920 --> 43:21.630
I've found

43:22.150 --> 43:23.960
a marriage for her.

43:24.320 --> 43:25.320
Marriage?

43:28.280 --> 43:29.190
Which family?

43:30.230 --> 43:31.630
Liu Siyu,

43:32.070 --> 43:34.400
the bureau director

43:35.190 --> 43:37.150
of the Zhejiang Division.

43:38.230 --> 43:40.110
His eldest son is eighteen,

43:40.510 --> 43:42.360
the same age as Jinzhao.

43:42.510 --> 43:43.480
I've thought it through.

43:44.400 --> 43:45.070
The new

43:45.510 --> 43:47.510
Junior Vice Minister of Revenue

43:47.710 --> 43:50.190
will be one of Fu Hailian's men.

43:50.880 --> 43:52.440
Liu Siyu is the only one

43:52.630 --> 43:54.110
in the entire Ministry

43:54.440 --> 43:56.280
who's Fu Hailian's protégé.

43:59.960 --> 44:01.030
He's about to leap

44:01.280 --> 44:02.960
from a mere bureau director

44:03.440 --> 44:05.030
to a senior ministerial post.

44:05.840 --> 44:07.030
But the Mistress is still here.

44:08.000 --> 44:09.000
Why should I be the one

44:09.000 --> 44:09.960
arranging Jinzhao's marriage?
